__pycache__/
!*.md
!*.txt
!*.jpg
!requirements*
!Dockerfile*
!*.sh
*.bat
*.zip
test*
# Modified by PixelMorph LLC, 2026-09-25 (recaster-dfl): keep the tests/ tree
# tracked despite upstream's test* pattern. __pycache__ is re-ignored because
# !tests/** would otherwise un-ignore it.
!tests/
!tests/**
tests/**/__pycache__/
# Modified by PixelMorph LLC, 2026-09-25 (recaster-dfl): model weights ship as
# a separate, checksummed artifact (see WEIGHTS.sha256 and NOTICE.md), never as
# git blobs.
facelib/*.npy
